# Runtime SQLite database. It holds live admin credentials, sessions and
# any admin-entered content — never a source-controlled file. A missing
# backend/menata.db is auto-created and seeded from seed-data.js on boot
# (schema + public content only; admin credentials come from ADMIN_PASSWORD).
backend/menata.db
backend/menata.db-wal
backend/menata.db-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

